      "data": {
        "label": "Ticketing & Booking — domain drill-down\n\nThe 7 services the flat landscape (#1) tags businessDomain=\"Ticketing & Booking\", re-hosted here as this domain's own sub-diagram, same tag values as #1. Cross-domain integration edges from #1 (e.g. to Payment Gateway Integration, Customer Profile Service) are omitted here for now — they'll come back once sibling domain sub-diagrams exist to connect to. Booking Session Manager links further down to a target-state AWS deployment view, testing the chd-diagrams skill's layout-guide.md conventions on a real diagram."
      }
